## 9. Audit Conclusion

audit_status: PASS

The Phase 1 repair is narrow and valid. The drift was caused by a schema-invalid top-level `node_id` in Fractal DAG ResultProposal artifacts. Removing that field from the top level restored schema conformance without relaxing schemas, weakening Post V&V, forcing GT accept, or forcing Root success. Canonical/root DAG, downstream live/matrix, and full-suite evidence are green after the repair.
